---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SafeHarInspector from "../components/SafeHarInspector.astro";
---

<Layout title="SafeHAR - Pembersih & Inspektor Berkas HAR 100% di Sisi Klien">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-12">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="text-center space-y-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z" />
        </svg>
        Privasi Penuh Sisi-Klien (Zero-Server Ingestion)
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
        Sanitasi Berkas HAR <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          100% Aman di Peramban Anda
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Bersihkan token otentikasi Bearer JWT, kuki sesi, kunci API Stripe, kredensial AWS, email, dan kartu pembayaran dari berkas HTTP Archive (.har) sebelum diunggah ke Zendesk, Salesforce, atau AWS Support.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Core Interactive Sanitizer Tool -->
    <section>
      <SafeHarInspector />
    </section>

    <!-- Architecture & Security Badges -->
    <section id="features" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          01
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Nol Pengiriman ke Peladen</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Berkas HAR diproses sepenuhnya di dalam Web Worker browser lokal melalui Web Streams API. Tidak ada bita data yang pernah meninggalkan peramban Anda.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          02
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Anti-Freeze Heap &lt; 60MB</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Menggunakan streaming parser inkremental 64KB (@streamparser/json). Mampu mengurai berkas raksasa hingga 500MB tanpa membuat memori V8 macet atau browser crash.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl p-6 space-y-2">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          03
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">9-Stage Regex Sanitizer</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Katalog penyensoran ketat berurutan: Bearer JWT, Basic Auth, Session Cookies, OAuth tokens, Stripe secret keys, AWS access keys, GitHub tokens, surel, & kartu kredit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
